# Proposed by the swarm's review (2026-10-14); the documenter may edit or drop it.
# Story: view 1 is "Mail on its own". Mail is then moved somewhere else in the
# arrangement. View 1, and Back, still frame Mail.
# Reference: T34 T35.
open Safari
open Notes
open Mail
dock 101 left
dock 102 right
dock 103 beside 101 bottom
zoom 103
save-view 1
show-all
# Mail steps out of Safari's column.
dock 103 right
expect left-of 101 103
view 1
expect camera 103
expect fills 103
show-all
# Dragged under Notes.
drag 103 1200 850 cmd
expect above 102 103
back
expect camera 103
# Arranging while zoomed in keeps the windows in the order they had.
arrange
expect camera root
expect above 101 102
expect left-of 101 103
view 1
expect fail
